WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.398
Paco, put together Hotel Brisa's quote.

2
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.496
Twelve units, hotel rate.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.968
Ten thousand eight hundred. In your drafts.

4
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:12.892
Send it.

5
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.201
And tell Dani.

6
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.943
Thursday at ten, in your calendar.

7
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.878
And chase the overdue invoices.

8
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.124
Nora's dentist moved to 5:30. Shall I move your yoga to tonight?

9
00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:27.875
Yes.

10
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.690
Twenty minutes for your back.

11
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.330
Nice and slow. Keep your back straight.

12
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:40.978
Ask Paco!

13
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.734
Or whatever you want to call me.
